<title>SWEDEN: Assa Abloy sees good '97 after strong '96.</title>
<headline>Assa Abloy sees good '97 after strong '96.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish lock maker, Assa Abloy, on Friday posted a 63 percent jump in pre-tax profit for 1996 and said it saw continued good results in 1997.</p>
</text>
